{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000584","compactId":"SO_0000584","id":"SO:0000584","label":"tmRNA","definition":{"text":"A tmRNA liberates a mRNA from a stalled ribosome. To accomplish this part of the tmRNA is used as a reading frame that ends in a translation stop signal. The broken mRNA is replaced in the ribosome by the tmRNA and translation of the tmRNA leads to addition of a proteolysis tag to the incomplete protein enabling recognition by a protease. Recently a number of permuted tmRNAs genes have been found encoded in two parts. TmRNAs have been identified in eubacteria and some chloroplasts but are absent from archeal and Eukaryote nuclear genomes.","xrefs":["http://www.sanger.ac.uk/cgi-bin/Rfam/getacc?RF00023"]},"comments":[],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"INSDC_feature:tmRNA"},{"scope":"related","value":"10Sa RNA"},{"scope":"related","value":"ssrA"}],"xrefs":["http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TmRNA"],"subsets":[],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0000584/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"mostRecent":{"hash":"5fe48bd4b720f8b140cb0f77461798c55532c097","shortHash":"5fe48bd","date":"2018-01-26","subject":"Add INSDC mappings","issueRefs":[]},"entries":[{"hash":"5fe48bd4b720f8b140cb0f77461798c55532c097","shortHash":"5fe48bd","date":"2018-01-26","subject":"Add INSDC mappings","issueRefs":[]},{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]}],"semanticEvents":[{"type":"synonym_added","date":"2018-01-26","commit":"5fe48bd4b720f8b140cb0f77461798c55532c097","shortHash":"5fe48bd","subject":"Add INSDC mappings","summary":"Synonym added: INSDC_feature:tmRNA","details":["Scope: exact"],"issueRefs":[]},{"type":"created","date":"2016-12-05","com